{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52721","headline":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 三 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"氐，四星似斗侧量米。\n天乳氐上黑一星，世人不识称无名。\n一个招摇梗河上，梗河横列三星状。\n帝席三黑河之西，亢池六星近摄提。\n氐下衆星骑官出，骑官之衆二十七。\n三三相连十欠一，阵车氐下骑官次，骑官下三车骑位。\n天辐两星列阵傍，将军阵里振威霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}